    "text": "今天來看到跆拳道項目",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 863.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "上屆聽奧在巴西舉奔",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 865.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "受到疫情影響",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 867.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "跆拳道最後只有孫樹良出賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 871.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而這一屆東京聽奧",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 874.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "除了63歲的老將孫樹良繼續出賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 879.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "曾經在土耳其薩姆松聽奧",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 883.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "拿下兩面同排的彭思廷",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 886.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "以及立志要奪下聽奧首面獎牌的謝成林",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 890.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "兩人也將重返賽場",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 892.76,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "在練習場上曾在土耳其薩姆松聽奧",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 898.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "跆拳道對打奪下同排的彭思廷",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 901.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "專注反覆練習踢技",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 903.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "培訓員在一旁協助",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 905.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "希望盡快找回比賽的節奏",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 907.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "四年前大家也沒有辦法請收我",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 910.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因為我也沒有去比賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 912.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以沒辦法請收中華隊我這位選手",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 915.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "今年我回歸到賽場上",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 918.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "對於他們來講我應該算蠻陌生的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 921.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "雖然缺席上一屆聽奧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 923.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但彭思廷仍對自己的表現充滿信心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 926.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "上屆也沒有參賽的謝成林",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 930.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "六月練習時不慎拉傷左大腿韌帶",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 933.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "休養兩個月後才逐步恢復訓練",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 936.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這次比賽對他來說",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 938.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "是最後一次挑戰聽奧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 940.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他勵志拼下自己的第一面獎牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 942.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "之後就要接手家裡的事業",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 945.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "一直不見我的左邊大腿韌帶",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 950.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "然後就是練習到現在",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 955.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "有強度慢慢地恢復該有的強度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 959.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "謝成林他去年參加過亞太聽奧的比賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 963.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "所以他的應該離比賽的感覺沒有很遠",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 967.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "彭思廷他是一個比較資深的選手",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 971.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以他只要在應該說這段時間",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 974.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "他都有在持續比較積極地在訓練",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 978.76,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "除了對打之外還有品勢項目",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 985.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "也就是跆拳道各項攻防動作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 988.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "按照一定規律組合在一起的固定套路",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 991.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這些代表團年紀最大63歲的村樹梁",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 994.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "曾在土耳其薩姆松聽奧與彭思廷搭檔",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 997.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "混合組配對",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 999.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "品勢拿下銅牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1001.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這次兩人再度合作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1003.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他在桃園我住台北",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1006.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "所以之前七月我自己坐火車去桃園的道館",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1011.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "跟他一起練幾次之後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1014.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "換他來台北一起練習",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1017.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這樣互相配合",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1019.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "默契有慢慢回來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1021.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "教練秦玉芳表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1023.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "三位選手經驗都很豐富",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1025.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "只要以平常心面對",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1027.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不要給自己太大壓力",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1029.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "相信都能夠有好成績",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1031.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "公視新聞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1032.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "牛軒文 吳嘉寶 臺北報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1034.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "而空手道代表隊則是有心血加入",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1039.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "兩位老將搭配四名小將",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1042.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "除了男子五個體重級別的對打項目",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1046.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "都有參賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1048.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "連續演示一套動作的型",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1051.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "個人與團體也都全數報名",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1055.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "教練表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1057.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "面對各國實力明顯提升",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1060.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "希望這次至少能夠再拿下一面銅牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1064.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "新秀蔡承君在中間",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1068.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其他選手圍繞四面出拳",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1070.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這是為了訓練空手道對打時的反應速度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1073.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "雖然是第一次參加聽證奧運",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1075.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "蔡承君展現出十足信心",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1078.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "立志要替臺灣拿下獎牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1081.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "對打要先把手放鬆",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1085.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "出拳迅速",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1087.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "要快",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1088.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "前踢",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1090.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "腳收緊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1091.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "踢出去",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1092.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "要很快的收緊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1094.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "才能踢得快",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1097.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這次東京聽證奧運",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1099.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "男子對打共有五個體重級別",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1101.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "臺灣代表隊在各級別都有參賽",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1104.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "教練坦言各國實力都在提升",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1107.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "要拿下獎牌並不容易",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1109.76,
    "duration": 20,
    "text": "代表隊中還有兩位老將坐鎮",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1129.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "其中四十七歲的呂金鋒曾在2009年聽奧拿下金牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1134.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他表示這次將是自己的最後一戰",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1137.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "希望能把經驗傳承給年輕選手",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1156.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "國民選手練習對打時只有高文夫在一旁獨自訓練",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1160.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因為他主攻的是行",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1162.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "也就是將各種技法串聯成完整套路的項目",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1166.76,
    "duration": 16,
    "text": "今年的話他更成熟",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1182.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "然後目標更清楚",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1184.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "所以我在幫他調整的地方變得更細",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1189.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但是一樣有缺點",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1192.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "就是不是學生了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1196.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "現在要工作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1197.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "那要兼顧工作訓練",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1200.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "高文夫這次也將看兩名隊友各做挑戰團體型",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1205.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他說團體項目最困難的是考驗默契",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1208.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "所有動作都必須一致",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1210.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "教練最後表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1212.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這次各國對手實力普遍提升",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1215.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "對打還要看嵌運",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1216.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "希望團隊能全力以赴",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1218.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "至少再度為台灣帶回一面銅牌",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1221.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "記者 牛軒文 吳嘉寶 台北報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1224.76,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "加拿大的馬桿疫情爆發超過一年",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1230.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "到現在已經累計超過了五千例",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1233.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "其中兩例死亡案件是早產兒",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1237.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他們在媽媽的子宮內就被感染",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1240.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "加拿大在一九九八年就取得馬診清零國家地位",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1245.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "雖然這一年疫情逐漸趨緩",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1249.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但是仍然無法完成目標",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1252.76,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "泛美衛生組織正式裁定取消馬診清零國家資格",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1258.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "許多家長帶著孩子到診所施打疫苗",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1261.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "傳染力極強的馬診病毒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1264.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在加拿大蔓延已經超過一年",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1266.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "到目前為止累計有五千一百三十八例",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1269.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "其中兩個死亡案例是早產兒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1272.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "加拿大在一九九八年取得馬診清零國家地位",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1275.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "兩年後美國也達成同樣的目標",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1278.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "美洲則是在二零一六年成為全球第一個消除馬診的地區",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1283.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "然而馬診疫情現在在加拿大爆發",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1286.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "而加拿大必須在十二個月內遏止病毒傳播",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1290.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "才能保住清零地位",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1292.76,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "但就在十號泛美衛生組織正式裁定",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1296.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "取消加拿大的馬診清零國家地位資格",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1299.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "加拿大的光榮紀錄維持了將近三十年",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1302.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "會失守是因為去年十月",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1305.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一名來自泰國的旅客在參加婚禮時",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1308.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在不知情的情況下感染給其他的賓客",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1311.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "專家解釋要實現馬診清零的目標",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1314.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "疫苗的覆蓋率就要高達百分之九十五",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1317.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這樣才會有群體免疫",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而馬診會在加拿大捲土重來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "則是因為兒童疫苗的接種率下降",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1324.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這次在加拿大馬診特別流行的地區",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1327.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "是門諾派教徒社區",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1329.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他們大多認為打疫苗會干擾自然法則",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1332.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不符合上帝的旨意",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也不信任政府",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1336.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因此選擇不打疫苗的氛圍濃厚",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1338.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "以馬診的傳染力來說",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1340.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "一名感染者就可以傳染給十個",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "沒有打過疫苗中的九個密切接觸者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1345.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "泛美衛生組織表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1347.76,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "除了加拿大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "今年發生在美洲的馬診案例",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1350.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "大多數是在美國 墨西哥和玻利維亞等十個國家",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1355.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "將近一萬兩千六百例",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1357.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "比二零二四年增加了三十倍",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公衛專家表示",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "預防馬診的最佳方法是接種疫苗",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.76,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "去年每週的馬診接種率為百分之七十九",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1366.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "跟往年比有所提高",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1368.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但仍然很低",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.76,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公視新聞沈陸配編譯",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1380.76,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "MING PAO CANADA | MING PAO TORONTO",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
